<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a seventh tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		  Feb 15, 2000   pvs	March 1, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.86 pct    6.64	  6.05 pct     6.80</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.64 pct    7.43	  6.91 pct     7.67</p>
<p> Assigned price 98.60	 96.65	 97.75	  94.80</p>
<p> Bids	     5.318 trln lire	   4.691 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.500 trln lire	   2.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on March 28.</p>
</text>
